From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Your Name <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix mismatched tag in forward declaration of DiagnosisConfiguration

`DiagnosisConfiguration` is defined as a struct in
`uds/DiagnosisConfiguration.h`, but `OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h`
forward declared it as a class. Clang reports that as
`-Wmismatched-tags` and MSVC as C4099, and the declaration suggests a
class with private data although the type is a plain aggregate.

The forward declaration now uses `struct`.

Signed-off-by: Your Name <you@example.com>
---
 libs/bsw/uds/include/uds/connection/OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/bsw/uds/include/uds/connection/OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h b/libs/bsw/uds/include/uds/connection/OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h
index f9ed3d36..be93cfdb 100644
--- a/libs/bsw/uds/include/uds/connection/OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h
+++ b/libs/bsw/uds/include/uds/connection/OutgoingDiagConnectionManager.h
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@ class ITransportMessageProvider;
 
 namespace uds
 {
-class DiagnosisConfiguration;
+struct DiagnosisConfiguration;
 class OutgoingDiagConnection;
 class DiagDispatcher;
 struct TransportJob;
